OL,3,GNEWSADuo completes second leg of
OL,4,Afloating car challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA floating car has completed a
OL,7,Fcross-sea journey for charity in less
OL,8,Fthan an hour.
OL,10,FPaul Phillips and Gary Ward took the
OL,11,Fyellow Daihatsu vehicle they converted
OL,12,Finto an amphibious vehicle on a
OL,13,Fthree-mile (4.8km) trip from Guernsey
OL,14,Fto Herm on Sunday.
OL,16,FThe 45-minute journey was part of a
OL,17,Ffundraising effort for the St John
OL,18,FAmbulance Flying Christine III marine
OL,19,Fambulance on which Phillips and Ward
OL,20,Fboth work as volunteers.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
