OL,3,GNEWSADuo completes second leg of
OL,4,Afloating car challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was the second trip the car has made
OL,7,Facross the water from Guernsey after it
OL,8,Fcompleted a nine-mile (14.5km) journey
OL,9,Fto Sark on 5 September with more than
OL,10,F#14,000 raised so far for the marine
OL,11,Fambulance.
